{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"Save a brand or agency"},"description":"Adds a brand or agency to the contact book, or changes one (partner_id). agency_id names the agency that handles a brand. do_not_contact keeps it out of pitches; show_on_kit lets it appear among past brands.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","properties":{"agency_id":{"anyOf":[{"format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$","type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"category":{"anyOf":[{"maxLength":60,"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"do_not_contact":{"type":"boolean"},"idempotency_key":{"description":"Any unique string, e.g. a UUID. A retry with the same key within 24 hours returns the first call's result instead of doing it again.","maxLength":255,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"kind":{"enum":["brand","agency"],"type":"string"},"name":{"maxLength":120,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"notes":{"anyOf":[{"maxLength":4000,"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"partner_id":{"format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$","type":"string"},"show_on_kit":{"type":"boolean"},"website":{"anyOf":[{"maxLength":500,"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"workspace":{"description":"Workspace ID. Optional when the connection has a default or only one workspace.","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$","type":"string"}},"type":"object"},"name":"partner_save","title":"Save a brand or agency"}
